"job posting. It can never appear in “About me” or among the technical "
"skills."

#: ancla/web/templates/language_form.html:48
msgid ""
"Las propone la IA a partir del nombre. No salen nunca en tu CV. Sirven "
"para que, si una vacante pide este idioma con otras palabras («advanced "
"English», «fluido»), la app no lo marque como un hueco que ya tienes "
"cubierto. Revísalas y añade las que falten."
msgstr ""
"These are suggested by the AI from the name. They never appear on your "
"CV. They mean that if a job posting asks for this language using "
"different words (“advanced English”, “fluent”), the app won't flag it as "
"a gap you already cover. Review them and add any that are missing."

#: ancla/web/templates/personal_skill_form.html:2
#: ancla/web/templates/personal_skill_form.html:4
